+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec; a search of the repository's documentation (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md) and codebase turned up no ADR, policy note, or changelog entry naming a chosen codec, only unrelated uses of the word "compression" (e.g., a mention of compression middleware in the gin-contrib ecosystem list) and unrelated uses of "codec" (e.g., the `codec/json` package and the Codecov code-coverage tool), so nothing current is recorded here.
